	)
	(text "TX winding: 0.36 mH, 0.63 ohm, 23 turns 0.8 mm Cu-equivalent Litz.  RX winding: 3.05 mH, 17.6 ohm, 63 turns 0.25 mm, SRF > 150 kHz incl. cable."
